  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "廣告與行銷溝通",
    "sub_ename": "ADVERTISING AND MARKETING COMMUNICATION",
    "describe_ch": "以「廣告原理」為基礎，強化學生「廣告策略」及「整合行銷」之專業企劃能力與技巧。經由課程研討與個案研究，培養學生行銷傳播溝通之能力。本課程讓學生瞭解基本之廣告概念, 對廣告的基礎理論作有系統的介紹及學習基本的廣告設計。",
    "describe_eh": "Use the \"academic advertising theory\" as the fundamental; strengthen student's professional ability and skill on advertising strategy and integrated marketing. Through the class discussion and case study. The course want to achieve the goal to enhance student's marketing communication and advertising ability and skill. This course will introduce the basic concept and theory of advertising, and basic skill of advertisement design.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
