    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": "<div>書面企劃報告 20%, 影片 20%, 口頭報告 20%, Team project 10%,&nbsp;出席 15%, 互評 15%</div>\n\n<div>Written project report 20%, video 20%, oral report 20%, team project 10%, attendance 15%, mutual evaluation 15%.</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": "<div>Written project report 20%, video 20%, oral report 20%, team project 10%, attendance 15%, mutual evaluation 15%.</div>\n",
    "course_pol": "希望同學在課堂上不要使用影印及盜版教材。上課期間在課堂上不得吃食，不得趴睡。若有需要短暫休息或進食，可以暫時離開教室，相關事宜若已完成或排除，應盡快返回課堂上課。\nStudents are expected to refrain from using photocopied and pirated textbooks in class. Students are not allowed to eat or sleep in class. If you need to take a short break or eat, you may leave the classroom temporarily and return to the classroom as soon as you have completed or eliminated any related matters.",
    "course_pol_en": "Students are expected to refrain from using photocopied and pirated textbooks in class. Students are not allowed to eat or sleep in class. If you need to take a short break or eat, you may leave the classroom temporarily and return to the classroom as soon as you have completed or eliminated any related matters.",
    "course_rem": "修讀課程希望同學要能做好課前預習，課後溫習，讓學習成效加倍。",
    "course_rem_en": "Students are expected to do a good job of studying before class and reviewing after class, so that they can learn twice as much as they should.",
    "ais_meno": "<div>\n<div>請對於引用資料標註參考來源</div>\n\n<div>希望同學在編寫學期報告時，應信守誠實及榮譽原則。鼓勵同學於研習課程內容和進行章末習題習作時，可進行小組討論，相互砥勵，以提昇學習成效。</div>\n</div>\n\n<div>Please cite the source of the quoted information.<br />\nIt is expected that students will adhere to the principles of honesty and honor in preparing their term papers. Encourage students to have group discussions and mutual encouragement in studying the course content and working on the end-of-chapter assignments in order to enhance their learning effectiveness.</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": "<div>Please cite the source of the quoted information.<br />\nIt is expected that students will adhere to the principles of honesty and honor in preparing their term papers. Encourage students to have group discussions and mutual encouragement in studying the course content and working on the end-of-chapter assignments in order to enhance their learning effectiveness.</div>\n",
    "ilearn_mk": null
